  "instruction": "look at `loose.brd`, tighten its design rules in the EAGLE DRC dialog, and save the updated board as `tight.brd`.\n\nRequired thresholds:\n- `mdWireWire` >= `0.15 mm`\n- `mdWirePad` >= `0.15 mm`\n- `mdWireVia` >= `0.15 mm`\n- `mdDrill` >= `0.30 mm`\n- `msWidth` >= `0.15 mm`\n- `msDrill` >= `0.30 mm`",
